As the title says, the game 'Ungate' will be retired from the store in the coming months. I would like to share some key information about this decision:

1. This was not an easy decision to make, but I can no longer sustain the funding required for the project;
2. Those who have already purchased the game will still be able to play and download it without any restrictions;

I want to express my profound gratitude to everyone who supported this project by acquiring it. This journey of creating and publishing a game—entirely on my own—has taught me so much. But, at this point, I need to step back and reevaluate my next steps, as I simply don’t have the financial resources to keep this dream moving forward.

I truly appreciate all the feedback I’ve received from users, and I hope everyone understands my decision. I hope this won’t disappoint anyone too much, as it’s a choice I’ve made with a heavy heart.

Thank you all for your support, and I hope to return in the future better prepared to tackle all the challenges ! :)

[b]Gameplay Improvement Based on Players Feedback:[/b]

I have made several updates to improve the gameplay:

1. At level 1 (surface), the statue next to "The Pass" that needs to be found in order to get to the "Swamp House" is now more visible;
2. At level 2 (underground), "The Book of the Dead" now has a special ability named "Spirit Guide" that can show you the path to find the demon hearts. This ability can be used only when the book is charged with the voices of spirits (it charges by itself);
3. Now, you don’t need to hold Ctrl to crouch; you can just press it once to crouch and once to uncrouch;
4. You can sprint while you are crouching, and the crouching mode will reset;

Now, the average gameplay should last 2 hours and 30 minutes, including running in circles. xD
